Build a web application that automates social media account creation, campaign management, and content scheduling.
The application should follow this flow system:

1. Login System

User authentication with email/username and password.



2. Account Generation

User inputs: First Name, Last Name, Date of Birth, Unique Username, Gender, Email Account.

System generates a unique cookie and fingerprint for each account.



3. Select Social Media Platform

User chooses which social media platform to create an account for (Instagram, Facebook, X/Twitter, TikTok, YouTube).



4. Account Creation Process

The system automatically registers the account.

Email verification step must be included.



5. Define Account Usage

User defines purpose (e.g., campaign, like, comment, repost, follow, share, join group, etc.).

User selects strategy: positive or negative.

User fills additional data for campaign or interaction needs.



6. AI Content Generation

AI generates content (text, image, video, GIF) based on provided input and strategy.



7. Scheduling

User creates a schedule for executing selected actions.

Include calendar and time selection.



8. Monitoring & Reporting Dashboard

Display logs of executed actions.

Show analytics of campaign performance.




Requirements:

Dashboard interface with clean navigation.

Separate lanes for User actions and System processes.

Support multi-platform automation.

AI integration for content generation.

Reporting module with charts and statistics.
